{"vid":"awRU0IFPotQ","source":"awRU0IFPotQ.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"the simple project we're building in"},{"t":1.5,"txt":"this video is one of the best exercises"},{"t":3.9,"txt":"that i know of to really hone aluminum"},{"t":6.6,"txt":"tig welding technique hey welcome to the"},{"t":8.8,"txt":"shop today we are going to be building a"},{"t":11.7,"txt":"basic aluminum cube i'm not the first to"},{"t":14.3,"txt":"do this project but i do think it is one"},{"t":16.4,"txt":"of the best exercises to do as you learn"},{"t":18.6,"txt":"tig welding obviously i could cut these"},{"t":20.3,"txt":"myself but i just purchased a kit"},{"t":22.1,"txt":"because i'd rather spend my time welding"},{"t":23.9,"txt":"i am going to clean up these sheer cut"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"edges now you could weld them just as is"},{"t":28.1,"txt":"and it would probably turn out just fine"},{"t":30,"txt":"i'll just use a scotch brite pad on a"},{"t":32,"txt":"rotary tool"},{"t":33.5,"txt":"now some people have had trouble with"},{"t":36,"txt":"wax deposits and things like that off of"},{"t":38.6,"txt":"pads like this i haven't had a lot of"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"issues but your results may vary i'm"},{"t":42.4,"txt":"going to wipe everything down with some"},{"t":44,"txt":"acetone on a rag and this just gets rid"},{"t":46.6,"txt":"of any dirt or debris in addition to the"},{"t":49.4,"txt":"actual pieces for my project i prepared"},{"t":52.1,"txt":"two coupons and this is something i like"},{"t":54,"txt":"to do whenever i'm working on an actual"},{"t":55.8,"txt":"project is just run a quick test weld"},{"t":58.6,"txt":"now as far as the ac settings we are"},{"t":60.4,"txt":"running that 140 amps and i have it set"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"to 75 electrode negative on my balance"},{"t":65.6,"txt":"that's going to work really well because"},{"t":67,"txt":"this is pretty clean material and i've"},{"t":68.9,"txt":"set the frequency to 80 hertz which"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"works pretty well for this thickness of"},{"t":72.8,"txt":"material i'd run a higher frequency for"},{"t":74.9,"txt":"thinner material and a lower frequency"},{"t":77.3,"txt":"for thicker material now in order to"},{"t":79,"txt":"tack aluminum together i'm just placing"},{"t":81.1,"txt":"it on the outside corner of my weld"},{"t":82.8,"txt":"table you could do this on a scrap piece"},{"t":85.2,"txt":"of square material or angle iron once"},{"t":87.7,"txt":"those are held in place i'll get my"},{"t":89.5,"txt":"tungsten in there with a nice arc length"},{"t":91.9,"txt":"and then i'll start off at a lower"},{"t":93.5,"txt":"amperage and then as soon as i see some"},{"t":97.1,"txt":"metal starting to form a puddle i'll"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"just floor it and give it full amperage"},{"t":101.4,"txt":"and let off and that usually works"},{"t":103.4,"txt":"pretty well for me to get an aluminum"},{"t":105.1,"txt":"tack without using filler there are some"},{"t":107.4,"txt":"people who will just go right in and"},{"t":108.8,"txt":"give it full amperage right away i like"},{"t":111.1,"txt":"to get my arc established first make"},{"t":113.4,"txt":"sure it's in the right place and then"},{"t":115.7,"txt":"give it that amperage run my pass along"},{"t":118.5,"txt":"here just making sure everything's"},{"t":120.2,"txt":"flowing in nicely and it seems to be"},{"t":121.8,"txt":"running pretty well i'm happy with it"},{"t":124.5,"txt":"at least that weld while not perfect is"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"good enough in order to put this cube"},{"t":128.5,"txt":"together i'm going to tack up the first"},{"t":130.6,"txt":"two pieces in the same way that i did"},{"t":132.6,"txt":"those coupons just placing it there on"},{"t":134.9,"txt":"that corner and putting attack in quick"},{"t":138.3,"txt":"hot and fast once i have two tacks on"},{"t":141,"txt":"that and i've formed that l shape i can"},{"t":143.5,"txt":"turn it on its side and then for the"},{"t":145.8,"txt":"rest of the pieces i'm going to set them"},{"t":148.1,"txt":"on top so they're offset a little bit"},{"t":150.7,"txt":"but i'll line up one corner so the"},{"t":153.1,"txt":"corner is just right and then tack it in"},{"t":156.1,"txt":"place and once that's locked in place i"},{"t":158.5,"txt":"can easily bend that tack and rotate it"},{"t":161,"txt":"around so the pieces line up i just"},{"t":163.4,"txt":"repeat this process to install each of"},{"t":166.2,"txt":"the pieces on my cube here"},{"t":168.9,"txt":"now that all of the parts are installed"},{"t":171,"txt":"it's time for a whole lot of welding now"},{"t":174.6,"txt":"in order to make this easier i'm going"},{"t":176.6,"txt":"to go ahead and deposit some extra"},{"t":178.9,"txt":"filler metal on each corner now i'm"},{"t":180.8,"txt":"trying to melt my material but not too"},{"t":183.4,"txt":"deep i'm mainly trying to deposit some"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"material so it'll be there to help me"},{"t":188,"txt":"out as i tie these welds together this"},{"t":191,"txt":"is a trip that i learned from roy"},{"t":193.2,"txt":"crumrine at crummy welding when i took a"},{"t":195.1,"txt":"welding class from him about a year ago"},{"t":197.4,"txt":"once i've deposited that filler metal"},{"t":199.5,"txt":"i'll go ahead and run a weld pass along"},{"t":202.4,"txt":"each side now as i run these outside"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"corner joints there are a few things to"},{"t":206.4,"txt":"keep in mind"},{"t":207.8,"txt":"one is i want to make sure that my arc"},{"t":209.7,"txt":"length is pretty short so i'm down in"},{"t":211.8,"txt":"that joint but not so far that i'm"},{"t":213.7,"txt":"dipping my tungsten now as i run along"},{"t":216.2,"txt":"here i'm also maintaining a good angle"},{"t":219.6,"txt":"where i'm coming in 45 degrees right"},{"t":222.6,"txt":"into that joint"},{"t":224.2,"txt":"and then i'm also making sure that my"},{"t":227.4,"txt":"filler metal is feeding directly right"},{"t":230,"txt":"into the front leading edge of that"},{"t":231.7,"txt":"puddle all the way along on each of"},{"t":234.1,"txt":"these joints and they're coming out"},{"t":235.8,"txt":"pretty well"},{"t":237,"txt":"i just take a second on each corner and"},{"t":240,"txt":"then"},{"t":240.9,"txt":"strike an arc real quick to help clean"},{"t":243.6,"txt":"it up and round it over"},{"t":245.4,"txt":"and the cube itself is done well at the"},{"t":248.8,"txt":"end of the day this cube turned out"},{"t":251.4,"txt":"pretty well it's not perfect but i'm"},{"t":253.4,"txt":"definitely happy with it if you learned"},{"t":255,"txt":"something let me know by hitting that"},{"t":256.3,"txt":"thumbs up or leave me a comment down"},{"t":258.1,"txt":"below and we'll see you next time"},{"t":314.7,"txt":"you"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"the"},{"t":0.16,"w":"simple"},{"t":0.48,"w":"project"},{"t":0.88,"w":"we're"},{"t":1.12,"w":"building"},{"t":1.439,"w":"in"},{"t":1.52,"w":"this"},{"t":1.76,"w":"video"},{"t":2.24,"w":"is"},{"t":2.32,"w":"one"},{"t":2.48,"w":"of"},{"t":2.56,"w":"the"},{"t":2.72,"w":"best"},{"t":3.199,"w":"exercises"},{"t":3.919,"w":"that"},{"t":4.08,"w":"i"},{"t":4.24,"w":"know"},{"t":4.48,"w":"of"},{"t":4.88,"w":"to"},{"t":5.12,"w":"really"},{"t":5.52,"w":"hone"},{"t":6,"w":"aluminum"},{"t":6.56,"w":"tig"},{"t":6.799,"w":"welding"},{"t":7.2,"w":"technique"},{"t":8,"w":"hey"},{"t":8.24,"w":"welcome"},{"t":8.559,"w":"to"},{"t":8.639,"w":"the"},{"t":8.8,"w":"shop"},{"t":9.12,"w":"today"},{"t":9.599,"w":"we"},{"t":9.84,"w":"are"},{"t":10,"w":"going"},{"t":10.24,"w":"to"},{"t":10.4,"w":"be"},{"t":10.639,"w":"building"},{"t":11.28,"w":"a"},{"t":11.679,"w":"basic"},{"t":12.32,"w":"aluminum"},{"t":13.12,"w":"cube"},{"t":13.599,"w":"i'm"},{"t":13.679,"w":"not"},{"t":13.84,"w":"the"},{"t":13.92,"w":"first"},{"t":14.24,"w":"to"},{"t":14.32,"w":"do"},{"t":14.48,"w":"this"},{"t":14.719,"w":"project"},{"t":15.12,"w":"but"},{"t":15.28,"w":"i"},{"t":15.44,"w":"do"},{"t":15.679,"w":"think"},{"t":15.92,"w":"it"},{"t":16,"w":"is"},{"t":16.24,"w":"one"},{"t":16.4,"w":"of"},{"t":16.4